  "veoParameterNote": "Veo runs against the Gemini Developer API (generativelanguage.googleapis.com predictLongRunning), not Vertex. `negativePrompt` is accepted there and maps to parameters.negativePrompt. `generateAudio` is deliberately absent: both official Google SDKs raise \"generateAudio parameter is only supported in Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform mode, not in Gemini Developer API mode\" (googleapis/python-genai _GenerateVideosConfig_to_mldev, googleapis/js-genai _models_converters), so sending it on this endpoint risks a 400 on every video. A silent clip is requested through negativePrompt instead.",
